Do not use decorative serif typography across every heading. A small editorial accent is acceptable only if it supports the modern product aesthetic.

### Surfaces and layouts

Use clean grids, asymmetric compositions, carefully layered UI previews, thin borders and subtle shadows.

Do not put every item inside an identical rounded card.

Create visual variety through layout, whitespace, colour blocks, large typography, charts, timelines, interactive demonstrations and carefully positioned interface elements.

